<!-- Paradise Deluxe on TomSVR_para, a personal MiSTer core for Yun Sung's Paradise-family boards, built on Jotego's JTFRAME.
     The ROM is assembled from your own MAME zip, unmodified. Requires TomSVR_para.rbf (v2, Oct 2026 or newer). -->
